- **\[x\] high** · `M1047 Audit` · `T1053.002, T1053.003, T1095, T1552.001, T1552.004, T1560.001, T1685, T1685.004, T1686`
  - Auditing is the process of recording activity and systematically reviewing and analyzing the activity and system configurations.
